   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "GLEIF lists this LEI's registration as LAPSED (last updated 2023-08-04) and records no accounting-consolidation parent (reporting exception NO_KNOWN_PERSON), so the control relationship below has no GLEIF Level 2 counterpart."
